ts?subject=EDNRA&object=EDN1&type=Complex&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">206</a>)<li/>EDNRA activates EDN1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EDNRA&object=EDN1&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">85</a>)<li/>EDNRA inhibits EDN1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EDNRA&object=EDN1&type=Inhibition&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">78</a>)<li/>EDNRA decreases the amount of EDN1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EDNRA&object=EDN1&type=DecreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">4</a>)<li/>EDNRA increases the amount of EDN1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EDNRA&object=EDN1&type=IncreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">3</a>)<li/>EDN1 activates EDNRA(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EDN1&object=EDNRA&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">144</a>)<li/>EDN1 inhibits EDNRA(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EDN1&object=EDNRA&type=Inhibition&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">10</a>)<li/>EDN1 increases the amount of EDNRA(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EDN1&object=EDNRA&type=IncreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">6</a>)<li/>EDN1 decreases the amount of EDNRA(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EDN1&object=EDNRA&type=DecreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">4</a>)</ul>","__edge_source":"INDRA + NCI-PID","__relationship_score":6.29156913955832,"__directed":true,"__reverse_directed":true,"i":"interacts with"}},{"id":89,"s":1,"t":3,"v":{"Relationships":"All Evidences (<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?agent0=EGFR&agent1=EDN1&format=html&expand_all=false\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">89</a>